OL,3,AChrista Pike discharged from hospital
OL,4,Aand returned to prison, her lawyers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike has
OL,7,Fbeen discharged from hospital following
OL,8,Fher botched execution at the end of
OL,9,Flast month, her lawyers have said.
OL,11,FThe 50-year-old murderer has been
OL,12,Freturned to the prison where she has
OL,13,Fspent the last 30 years, according to a
OL,14,Fstatement from her lawyers on Saturday.
OL,16,FShe is continuing to receive medical
OL,17,Fcare at the prison.
OL,19,FPike survived two lethal injections of
OL,20,Fthe drug pentobarbital on 30 September,
OL,21,Fwhich left her in a critical condition
OL,22,Fin hospital.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
